# Shot 8: /ship checks, commits named paths, and pushes. Guardrail asks; this time you approve.
Output public/clips/ship.mp4
Source tapes/common/settings.tape
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "node scenes/run.mjs ship"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Show

Sleep 1s
# cue: prompt
Type "/ship"
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 300ms
# cue: checks
Sleep 3600ms
# cue: dialog
Sleep 3s
Enter
Sleep 300ms
# cue: approve
Sleep 2500ms
# cue: report
Sleep 4500ms
